		// gate). A span returned to mcentral (owning_p = MSPAN_OWNING_P_PARKED) or
		// handed to another P keeps free_count != 0, so the depletion check above
		// cannot detect a RECYCLED span; popping it would corrupt a span another P
		// owns. owning_p (+0x40) is stamped == rawId for the owning P, so treat
		// not-owned-by-this-P as a miss. No-op on the single-M arm64/wasm runtimes;
		// closes the multi-M recycle race on the x64 worker-pool runtime (x64 TSO
		// makes the plain load acquire-ordered, so no explicit barrier is needed).
		if __Internals.loadIndirect(cachedSpan + 0x40) != rawId 'notOwned'
			miss = true
		end 'notOwned'
